    <string name="legal_privacy_body">Stark Signal processes recordings, imported media, and transcripts on this device. It has no Internet permission, analytics, ads, account system, or cloud storage. Files leave only when you explicitly save or share them. Private-vault data is excluded from Android backup and is removed when the app is uninstalled.</string>
    <string name="legal_recording_body">Laws about recording and consent differ by location and situation. You are responsible for obtaining any consent that applies before you record or share audio. Stark Signal does not record secretly and keeps a visible notification active during background recording.</string>
    <string name="legal_licenses_body">Stark Signal is released under GNU GPL version 3. AndroidX, Kotlin, Media3, whisper.cpp, and other components retain their own copyright and license notices.</string>
    <string name="legal_about_body">A local-first recorder, media preparation tool, and offline transcription workspace designed to keep your audio under your control.</string>
